flowchart TD
%% v2 Face Recognition Workflow
%% Aligns with CONSOLIDATED_FACE_DETECTION_PLAN.md Section 4.2

A[Browser: MediaPipe face detection] --> B[Frontend: POST /recognition/identify]
B --> C[WordPress: Crop faces server-side]
C --> D[Recognition Service: /embeddings/batch]
D --> E{Roster exists?}
E -->|Yes: Warm Start| F[[suggest endpoint]]
E -->|No: Cold Start| G[[cluster-unknowns endpoint]]

F --> H{FAISS similarity search}
H -->|score >= threshold 0.92| I[Return top-k suggestions]
H -->|score < threshold| G

G --> J[DBSCAN/Agglomerative clustering]
J --> K[Return clusterId for grouping]

I --> L[Frontend: PeopleDrawer suggestion stacks]
K --> M[Frontend: PeopleDrawer unknown clusters]

L --> N{User action}
M --> N

N -->|Confirm suggestion| O[POST /identify with label.rosterId]
N -->|Create new person| P[POST /identify with label.newName]
N -->|Bulk confirm stack| Q[POST /identify with multiple labels]

O --> R[WP: persist FaceObservation + sync to FAISS]
P --> S[WP: create RosterPerson + persist + sync to FAISS]
Q --> R

R --> T[Recognition Service: /roster/add-embedding]
S --> T
T --> U[Append to FAISS index - prevent duplicate observationId]
U --> V[Persist index atomically]

V --> W[Return success + immediate user feedback]
W --> X[Toast: Face added to person's profile]
X --> Y[Future suggestions improve progressively]
